{"ID":"20240206111939-c87n3kv","Spec":"1","Type":"NodeDocument","Properties":{"id":"20240206111939-c87n3kv","scroll":"\u0026#123;\u0026quot;rootId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240206111939-c87n3kv\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;startId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240206111949-19mzthd\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;endId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240206111943-jmvyjn9\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;scrollTop\u0026quot;:0,\u0026quot;focusId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240206111949-19mzthd\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;focusStart\u0026quot;:162,\u0026quot;focusEnd\u0026quot;:162\u0026#125;","title":"谷精草","type":"doc","updated":"20240902174509"},"Children":[{"ID":"20240206111949-19mzthd","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240206111949-19mzthd","updated":"20240206111950"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【产地】\t主产于安徽、江西、江苏、浙江等地。\n【性状】\t花序呈扁圆形，直径45mm；底部有鳞片状浅黄色的总苞片，紧密排列呈盘状；小花3040朵，灰白色，排列甚密，表面附有白色的细粉；用手搓碎后，可见多数黑色小粒及灰绿色小形种子。花序下连一细长的花茎，长约1518cm，黄绿色，有光泽；质柔，不易折断。臭无，味淡，久嚼则成团。"}]},{"ID":"20240206111952-fnmey58","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240206111952-fnmey58"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【性味】\t辛、甘，平。"}]},{"ID":"20240206111957-f44dd5e","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240206111957-f44dd5e"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【功效】\t祛风散热，明目退翳。 治目翳，雀盲，头痛，齿痛，喉痹，鼻衄。"}]},{"ID":"20240206111959-yaa8kzm","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240206111959-yaa8kzm"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【注解】\t“谷精珠”：为植物华南谷精草E. sexangulare L. 及毛谷精草E. australe R. Br的头状花序。此非正品。头状花序较小，直径24mm，灰黄色，小花十几朵，较疏松排列，花茎细而柔软，有时带有叶片。"}]},{"ID":"20240206111943-jmvyjn9","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240206111943-jmvyjn9","updated":"20240206111943"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"image"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/image-20240206111943-hv4ei5e.png"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240726162101-5nuruss","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240726162101-5nuruss","updated":"20240726162823"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 410px;","style":"width: 400px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"谷精草 (1)"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/谷精草 1-20240726162101-js5mvz5.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 400px;\" parent-style=\"width: 410px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 390px;","style":"width: 380px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"谷精草 (6)"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/谷精草 6-20240726162823-ocga265.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 380px;\" parent-style=\"width: 390px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240726162112-5iymwls","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240726162112-5iymwls","updated":"20240726162936"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 576px;","style":"width: 566px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"谷精草"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/谷精草-20240726162112-vck534q.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 566px;\" parent-style=\"width: 576px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 577px;","style":"width: 567px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"谷精草 (8)"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/谷精草 8-20240726162936-1ml4sng.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 567px;\" parent-style=\"width: 577px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240726162631-4dtydo6","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240726162631-4dtydo6","updated":"20240726162631"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 578px;","style":"width: 568px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"谷精草 (5)"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/谷精草 5-20240726162622-8irmthi.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 568px;\" parent-style=\"width: 578px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 657px;","style":"width: 647px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"谷精草 (2)"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/谷精草 2-20240726162252-ztnd2jd.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 647px;\" parent-style=\"width: 657px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240726162412-zwaqvp8","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240726162412-zwaqvp8","updated":"20240726162856"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 400px;","style":"width: 390px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"谷精草 (4)"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/谷精草 4-20240726162545-p9knvra.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 390px;\" parent-style=\"width: 400px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 854px;","style":"width: 844px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"谷精草 (7)"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/谷精草 7-20240726162856-xplu64q.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 844px;\" parent-style=\"width: 854px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240726162856-tmqtr5c","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240726162856-tmqtr5c","updated":"20240726163401"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 437px;","style":"width: 427px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"谷精草 (3)"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/谷精草 3-20240726162412-dfccnla.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 427px;\" parent-style=\"width: 437px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 798px;","style":"width: 788px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"谷精草 (9)"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/谷精草 9-20240726163401-c17kqcv.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 788px;\" parent-style=\"width: 798px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240726162416-cb6clku","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240726162416-cb6clku"}},{"ID":"20240902174501-ycbh97a","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902174501-ycbh97a","updated":"20240902174509"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"中草药：小谷精草"}]},{"ID":"20240902174501-1zro0tc","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902174501-1zro0tc","updated":"20240902174509"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"小谷精草"}]},{"ID":"20240902174501-55r3mwm","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902174501-55r3mwm","updated":"20240902174509"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【出处】始载于《中国高等植物图鉴》。"}]},{"ID":"20240902174501-uhuoxwr","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902174501-uhuoxwr","updated":"20240902174509"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【拼音名】XiǎoGǔJīnɡCǎo"}]},{"ID":"20240902174501-t01m5yi","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902174501-t01m5yi","updated":"20240902174509"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【英文名】flowerofSmallpipewort"}]},{"ID":"20240902174501-kc8sbiy","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902174501-kc8sbiy","updated":"20240902174509"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【别名】戴星草、文星草、流星草、移星草、珍珠草、鱼眼草、天星草、佛顶珠、灌耳草、翳子草、满天星、羊壳珠、金箍棒、鼓锤草、谷星草、谷精子、耳朵刷子、挖耳朵草、衣钮草、癞痢头草"}]},{"ID":"20240902174501-jlvz6ql","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902174501-jlvz6ql","updated":"20240902174509"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【来源】"}]},{"ID":"20240902174501-630c1dp","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902174501-630c1dp","updated":"20240902174509"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"药材基源：为谷精草科植物谷精草、白药谷精草、华南谷精草和毛谷精草等带花茎的头状花序。"}]},{"ID":"20240902174501-ewuayev","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902174501-ewuayev","updated":"20240902174509"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"拉丁植物动物矿物名：1.EriocaulonbuergerianumKoern.2.EriocauloncinereumR.Br.[E.sieboldianumSieb.etZucc.；E.heteranthumBenth.；E.formosanumHayata]3.EriocaulonsexangulareL.[E.wallichianumMart.]4.EriocaulonaustraleR.Br."}]},{"ID":"20240902174501-ii2949w","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902174501-ii2949w","updated":"20240902174509"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"采收和储藏：秋季采收，将花茎拔出，除净泥杂，晒干。"}]},{"ID":"20240902174501-rlol2rw","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902174501-rlol2rw","updated":"20240902174509"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【原形态】1.须根多数，细软，稠密。无茎。叶基生，线状披针形，长6-20cm，中部宽3-4mm，基部最宽可达8mm，先端稍钝，有纵脉10余条，叶片上有纵横脉构成的透明小方格。花葶多数，长短不一，高者达30cm，短于或较高于叶片；头状花序近球形，直径4-6cm，总苞片倒卵形，长2-2.5mm，杆黄色；花苞片倒卵形，先端骤尖，长约2mm，上部密被短毛。雄花较少，外轮花被片合生成倒卵形苞状，先端3片裂，钝，有短毛，内轮花被片合生成倒圆锥状筒形；雄蕊6，花药黑色，长0.2mm；雌花多数，生子花序周围，几无花梗；外轮花被片合生成椭圆形苞状，内轮花被片3，离生，匙形，先端有一黑色腺体，有细长毛；雌蕊1，子房3室，柱头3裂。蒴果三棱状球形，长约1mm。种子长椭圆形，有毛茸。花、果期7-12月。2.白药谷精草本种与谷精草区别在于：叶丛生，叶片狭线形。头状花序疏松，无白粉；雄花的萼片通常合生，裂片背部不呈龙骨状凸起，花药白色；雌花萼片2-3，离生，狭线开，花瓣缺。3.华南谷精草生于本种与前两种的区在于：头状花序坚实，被白粉；雄花的萼片与雌花的形状相似，均3片，其中2片较大，呈舟状，背面有翅状的龙骨突起。叶长6.5-15cm，背面无毛；总花梗稍比叶长。4.毛谷精草本种与前三种的区别在于：叶长达60cm，背面被长流柔毛；总花梗通常与叶等长，稀长于叶一倍。头状花序坚实，被白粉，干时形状也不改变；外苞片短于花序；雄花瓣先端密被长柔毛，有黑色腺点；雌花瓣狭线形，较厚，先端密被长柔毛，下有黑色腺点。"}]},{"ID":"20240902174501-jz8jdkd","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902174501-jz8jdkd","updated":"20240902174509"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【生境分布】"}]},{"ID":"20240902174501-vb0bp3l","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902174501-vb0bp3l","updated":"20240902174509"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"生态环境：1.2.白药谷精草生于水田、沟边。3.华南谷精草生于水田或溪沟湿地。4.毛谷精草生于水田或溪沟湿地。"}]},{"ID":"20240902174501-1789vgf","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902174501-1789vgf","updated":"20240902174509"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"资源分布：1.2.白药谷精草分布于华东、中南及山西、陕西、台湾、贵州等地。3.华南谷精草分布于福建、台湾、湖南、广东、海南、广西等地。4.毛谷精草分布于广东、海南、广西、四川、云南等地。"}]},{"ID":"20240902174501-slkcewh","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902174501-slkcewh","updated":"20240902174509"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【栽培】"}]},{"ID":"20240902174501-7w19ajw","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902174501-7w19ajw","updated":"20240902174509"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"栽培要点生物学特性喜温暖潮湿气候，忌干旱、忌严寒。宜选择水田或低湿地栽培。"}]},{"ID":"20240902174501-u5mwizg","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902174501-u5mwizg","updated":"20240902174509"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"栽培技术用种子繁殖：秋季采收成熟花葶，晒干，搓碎后收集种子待播。春季，每1hm2田或地用种子15kg左右，均匀撒播，播种时放于田水，发芽出苗后灌浅水养护。"}]},{"ID":"20240902174501-9j2uda4","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902174501-9j2uda4","updated":"20240902174509"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"田间管理生长期拔除杂草3-4次，追肥至1-2次；定期灌水，保持土壤湿润。"}]},{"ID":"20240902174501-ltsg462","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902174501-ltsg462","updated":"20240902174509"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【性状】"}]},{"ID":"20240902174501-xpxs36q","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902174501-xpxs36q","updated":"20240902174509"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"药材鉴别性状鉴别本品为带有花茎的头状花序，多扎成小把。全体呈淡棕色。花茎纤细，长14-24cm，直径不及1mm，表面淡黄绿色，有4-5条扭曲棱线，质柔软，不易折断。"}]},{"ID":"20240902174501-sdqh671","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902174501-sdqh671","updated":"20240902174509"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"头状花序半球形，直径4-5mm；底部有黄白色总苞，总苞片膜质，倒卵形，紧密排列成盘状。小花数十朵，灰白色，排列甚密，表面附有白粉。用手搓碎花序，可见多数黑色花药及细小灰绿色未成熟的果实。气微，味淡。以珠（花序）大而紧、色灰白，花茎短、色黄绿者为佳。"}]},{"ID":"20240902174501-cl16548","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902174501-cl16548","updated":"20240902174509"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"显微鉴别粉末特征：①花茎表皮细胞长方形，表面可见纵直角质层纹；气孔类长方形，保卫细胞长条形，与副卫细胞相平行。②花茎通气组织细胞类圆形或椭圆形，有的含细小草酸钙棱晶或柱晶。③苞片表皮细胞长方形或略呈棱形。④花被片表皮细胞表面观呈多角形。⑤非腺毛1-4细胞，长可达1200μm。③腺毛头部1-4细胞，单列，长椭圆形或长条形，长150-218μm，腺柄单细胞，细胞短。①花粉囊内壁细胞螺纹加厚。③花粉粒直径约27μm，外壁具点状突起。③子房壁表皮细胞多角形，壁呈念珠状增厚。"}]},{"ID":"20240902174501-h7g6shc","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902174501-h7g6shc","updated":"20240902174509"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【性味】辛；甘；平"}]},{"ID":"20240902174501-7viysf6","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902174501-7viysf6","updated":"20240902174509"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【归经】胃；肺经"}]},{"ID":"20240902174501-yynz75i","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902174501-yynz75i","updated":"20240902174509"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【功能主治】祛风散热；明目退翳。主目赤翳障；羞明流泪；雀目；头痛；鼻渊；喉痹；牙痛及风疹瘙痒"}]},{"ID":"20240902174501-7q2r35w","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902174501-7q2r35w","updated":"20240902174509"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【用法用量】内服：煎汤9-12g；或入丸、散。外用：适量，煎汤外洗；或烧存性，研末外撒；或为末吹鼻、烧烟熏鼻。"}]},{"ID":"20240902174501-k256vjx","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902174501-k256vjx","updated":"20240902174509"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【注意】血虚目疾慎服；忌用铁器煎药。"}]},{"ID":"20240902174501-o0sd3sw","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902174501-o0sd3sw","updated":"20240902174509"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【各家论述】《新华本草纲要》：花序或全草：味辛、甘、性微温。有明目退翳、止痛功能。用于结膜炎、咽喉肿痛、牙痛、感冒发热、头痛。"}]},{"ID":"20240902174501-wc9qnqb","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902174501-wc9qnqb","updated":"20240902174509"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【摘录】《中华本草》"}]},{"ID":"20240902174504-fa6c64a","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240902174504-fa6c64a","updated":"20240902174509"}},{"ID":"20240902174505-ku1nkqg","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902174505-ku1nkqg","updated":"20240902174509"}}]}